1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:07,910
On a quiet desk, in a quiet room, sat a book that nobody had opened in a very long time.
安静的书桌上，安静的房间里，有一本很久很久没人翻开的书。

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,880
Until one evening… somebody did.
直到某个傍晚……有人翻开了它。

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,400
Inside, in a land made entirely of paper, lived a little sprite named Pip.
书里有一片全用纸做成的土地，住着一个叫皮普的小精灵。

4
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,600
Good morning, Papervale!
早上好，纸片谷！

5
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:31,030
Pip loved Papervale. The cardboard hills. The paper sun on its wooden stick.
皮普喜欢纸片谷：硬纸板的山丘，插在木棍上的纸太阳，

6
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:35,010
And the river, that went swish… swish… swish.
还有那条哗啦、哗啦、哗啦的小河。

7
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:40,450
But every evening, when the sun went down, another light came on.
可每到傍晚太阳落下，另一盏灯就会亮起。

8
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:45,200
A big, warm light, from somewhere beyond the edge of the page.
又大又暖的光，从书页边缘之外的某个地方照进来。

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:48,700
I'm going to find out where it comes from!
我要去找到它从哪里来！

10
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,050
So Pip set off, through the Whispering Woods,
于是皮普出发了，穿过窃窃私语森林，

11
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:01,100
Hmph! Nobody gets past ME!
哼！谁也别想过去！

12
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:08,470
where Pip learned that a grumpy crumple… just needs someone to smooth things out.
在那里皮普明白了：皱巴巴的坏脾气，只是需要有人帮它抚平。

13
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:11,700
Wheee! I'm Fold! Let's go!
呜呼！我叫折折！出发吧！

14
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,940
Together, they sailed the Swish-Swash Sea,
他们一起驶过哗啦哗啦海，

15
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:26,780
on through the night, beneath the stars on their strings,
穿过夜色，在一颗颗挂在线上的星星下，

16
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:36,600
until they reached the very last page. Nothing else was drawn there. Just two words. The End.
直到最后一页。那里什么都还没画，只有两个词：The End（全书完）。

17
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,100
Pip had never been off the page before. It was a little bit scary.
皮普从没离开过书页。有一点点害怕。

18
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:43,300
Here goes!
冲啦！

19
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:45,700
But the best adventures always are.
可最好的冒险，总是这样。

20
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:57,300
And that is how Pip found out where the big, warm light came from.
就这样，皮普找到了那束又大又暖的光从哪里来。

21
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:00,300
A reading lamp… and someone, reading along.
一盏台灯……还有一个正在读故事的人。

22
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:03,400
Hello, big world!
你好，大大的世界！

23
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,440
The end? Or maybe… just the beginning.
结束了？也许……才刚刚开始。
